# Variable NAMES only. Never put a real value here, and never commit .env.
#
# Secrets are never environment values in this project. On the server they are
# files under /etc/nightshift/secrets/<consumer>/, created by
# host/setup/secrets-init.sh, and services read them through *_FILE settings
# that hold the path (docs/design/host-ops.md, "Server-side state").
#
# No service reads environment variables yet. Each one adds its names here when
# it is built, with a comment saying what each name is for.
